WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:11.180
72. Look away from the light. Smartphones have changed the way we live. We use them

2
00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:16.020
for just about everything now, communicating, learning, laughing, and even getting around

3
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:21.660
our cities. But not all the changes have been good ones. One negative consequence of our

4
00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:27.820
smartphone use is that it's wreaking havoc on our body's natural cycles. The problem

5
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:33.420
has to do with the blue light given off by smartphones and other electronics. Blue light

6
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:39.580
has a very short wavelength and produces a higher amount of energy than normal light.

7
00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.260
Smartphone producers favor it because it matches the brightness of sunlight. This makes it

8
00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:49.420
easier to read what's on your smartphone's screen in daylight. But it's this very

9
00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:55.260
similarity to sunlight that causes our body's problems. The human body normally releases

10
00:00:55.260 --> 00:01:00.980
a chemical called melatonin after the sun goes down. This chemical tells us it's time

11
00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:06.820
to go to sleep. But here's where your smartphone comes in. Imagine a normal evening of riding

12
00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:12.140
the bus home, cooking dinner, and then going to bed. You're probably checking your smartphone

13
00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:17.180
the whole time, right? Well, all that blue light is tricking your body into thinking

14
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.580
that it's still daytime. As a result, your natural cycle is disturbed and it's harder

15
00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:28.140
to get a good night's sleep. A disturbed sleep cycle has been proven to lead to other

16
00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:33.180
health problems. In one study, researchers linked working a night shift to increase

17
00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:39.540
chances of diabetes and heart disease. Luckily, we're not totally powerless. There are some

18
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:45.380
things we can do to beat blue light. Try to avoid using your smartphone for an hour or

19
00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:51.460
two before bed. There are also special glasses you can buy to block out blue light. And you

20
00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:56.140
could always just stop using your smartphone altogether. Good luck with that one.
